<title>UK: Aluminium output rose in November - IPAI.</title>
<headline>Aluminium output rose in November - IPAI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daily average primary aluminium output in November rose to 51,700 tonnes compared with 51,100 in October and 47,600 in November 1995, provisional figures from the International Primary Aluminium Institute (IPAI) show.</p>
<p>Total production in November (30 days) was 1.551 million tonnes, compared with 1.585 million in October (31 days) and 1.428 million in Novemeber 1995.  </p>
<p>The regional breakdown of primary aluminium production was as follows (in thousands of tonnes) the IPAI said.</p>
<p>				Nov 96   Oct 96   Nov 95</p>
<p>    Africa		    90	 93	 62</p>
<p>    North America	  483	499	439</p>
<p>    Latin America	  173	179	172</p>
<p>    East/South Asia	139	138	136</p>
<p>    Europe West	    263	270	n/a</p>
<p>    Europe East/Central  263	263	n/a</p>
<p>    Oceania		  140	143	129</p>
</text>
